(7460667, 1182816, 136989, '<td valign="top">Love the details in the tree limbs and grasses.  Perfect lake without any reflections for this challenge.  The boat adds a splash of interest and the whole thing makes me want to go for a hike.  My favorite in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Updated to remove the bling per PM from Mark.  Leaving the comments though.  :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-06-22 00:57:57.</i></td>', 'Love the details in the tree limbs and grasses.  Perfect lake without any reflections for this challenge.  The boat adds a splash of interest and the whole thing makes me want to go for a hike.  My favorite in this challenge. Updated to remove the bling per PM from Mark.  Leaving the comments though.  :)', '2016-06-18 23:58:53.000000', '2016-06-22 01:57:57.000000', 1),
(7460686, 1182773, 37858, '<td valign="top">A very nice sense of "landscape" in the conventional use of the word, and an effective image to boot.  Worthy of a ribbon IMHO.</td>', 'A very nice sense of "landscape" in the conventional use of the word, and an effective image to boot.  Worthy of a ribbon IMHO.', '2016-06-19 04:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7460687, 1182740, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation of "landscape" IMHO.  I would give it a ribbon.</td>', 'Nice interpretation of "landscape" IMHO.  I would give it a ribbon.', '2016-06-19 04:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7460688, 1182711, 37858, '<td valign="top">If this isn''t a ribbon winner, I''ll do penance by going on a long hike with my camera and try to figure out what I am missing.  Love the colors and back-lighting.</td>', 'If this isn''t a ribbon winner, I''ll do penance by going on a long hike with my camera and try to figure out what I am missing.  Love the colors and back-lighting.', '2016-06-19 04:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7460689, 1182781, 37858, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  Front page material IMHO.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  Front page material IMHO.', '2016-06-19 04:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7460690, 1182816, 37858, '<td valign="top">I really like this image with the placement of the boat and the curve of the water line.  Nicely done.  I''m betting this will be on the first page.</td>', 'I really like this image with the placement of the boat and the curve of the water line.  Nicely done.  I''m betting this will be on the first page.', '2016-06-19 04:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7460691, 1182758, 37858, '<td valign="top">A very inviting image.  Now I have six favorite images for the front page.  Hmmm... (I''m pretty sure that won''t work out, but can''t decide which one I would drop if given the choice.)  This is one of the six, of course.</td>', 'A very inviting image.  Now I have six favorite images for the front page.  Hmmm... (I''m pretty sure that won''t work out, but can''t decide which one I would drop if given the choice.)  This is one of the six, of course.', '2016-06-19 04:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7460692, 1182693, 37858, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing photograph.  I like the processing quite a lot.</td>', 'Very intriguing photograph.  I like the processing quite a lot.', '2016-06-19 04:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7460693, 1182618, 37858, '<td valign="top">An interesting location and a great subject for this challenge.  I would prefer processing that was not quite so even-toned.  I bit more contrast might be preferable (at least to me).  I will be interested to see how well this scores.</td>', 'An interesting location and a great subject for this challenge.  I would prefer processing that was not quite so even-toned.  I bit more contrast might be preferable (at least to me).  I will be interested to see how well this scores.', '2016-06-19 04:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7460694, 1182809, 37858, '<td valign="top">This is one of two photos in the challenge that I like a lot but wish a bit more contrast was applied.  IMHO the photo could benefit from a bit less mid-tones.  Still, it is a good subject matter for this challenge.  I will be interested to see how high it scores.</td>', 'This is one of two photos in the challenge that I like a lot but wish a bit more contrast was applied.  IMHO the photo could benefit from a bit less mid-tones.  Still, it is a good subject matter for this challenge.  I will be interested to see how high it scores.', '2016-06-19 04:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7460716, 1182703, 115814, '<td valign="top">Not typically a fan of so much detail and busyness, but the range of tones, balanced composition and exquisitely controlled processing wins me over. Very nice!</td>', 'Not typically a fan of so much detail and busyness, but the range of tones, balanced composition and exquisitely controlled processing wins me over. Very nice!', '2016-06-19 16:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
